note: Increase and Decrease change a number variable.
Define score as 10.
Increase score by 5
say 'score'
Decrease score by 3
say 'score'

ask "Guess a number" and save answer as guess
if 'guess' is equal to 7 then say "That is the one!" and
otherwise if not a number then say "That was not a number at all." and
otherwise if 'guess' is lesser than 7 then ask "Too low — try again" and save answer as guess and
otherwise ask "Too high — try again" and save answer as guess
